{
  "slug": "social-automation",
  "name": "Social Automation",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate, schedule, and monitor trilingual social posts (EN/PT/ES) across LinkedIn and X. Produces AI-generated infographics, manages a Google Sheets-based content calendar, and reports on daily posting status and engagement. Includes 3 skills: social-generate, social-schedule, and social-status.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**, **1 agent**, **4 commands** and **4 MCP servers**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `content-calendar` (Plan and manage a social content calendar from a Google Sheets CMS), `multilingual-adapter` (Adapt social posts from English to Portuguese (PT) and Spanish (ES) while preserving the voice, data points, and…), `performance-review` (Weekly social media performance review), `post-generator` (Generate social media posts for LinkedIn and X from a source article, URL, or topic)\n- **Agents** (1): `weekly-social-batch` (Autonomous weekly social content batch)\n- **Commands** (4): `calendar` (Review and fill the social content calendar), `generate` (Generate LinkedIn and X posts from a URL, topic, or finding), `report` (Weekly social performance report), `translate` (Adapt an English social post to Portuguese (PT) and Spanish (ES))\n- **MCP servers** (4): `~~documents`, `~~linkedin`, `~~knowledge_base`, `~~crawler`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install social-automation@claude-community` from `arturseo-geo/cowork-social-automation`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
